(#5253, #5270, thanks @JJLiebig)\n- Adding a Windows machine no longer prints raw PowerShell progress output. (#4639, #5282, thanks @JJLiebig)\n","reactions":{"total_count":8,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":8,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":1}
